# Pre-launch scratch hygiene (2026-06-20). Patterns below cover one-off
# session scripts and audit-output artifacts that accumulate during daily
# work. Already-committed files stay tracked (gitignore doesn't untrack);
# force-add with `git add -f` if a new file matches but should be committed.

# Root-level audit/recipe scratch
/_*.txt
/_*.json

# mlb_pipeline scratch outputs
mlb_pipeline/_*.txt
mlb_pipeline/_*.csv
mlb_pipeline/_*.json
mlb_pipeline/_*_out.txt

# Per-sport alias gap audit logs — regenerated on each enrichment/resolver run
mlb_pipeline/*_alias_gaps.log

# mlb_pipeline daily-session scripts — not persistent infra
mlb_pipeline/_check_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_card_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_morning_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_eod_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_deep_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_full_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_tonight_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_today_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_apply_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_verify_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_resolver_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_model_*.py
mlb_pipeline/_jerry_*.py

# All underscore-prefixed scratch in mlb_pipeline. Already-committed
# files (audits we kept, backtests with shipped findings) stay tracked
# because gitignore doesn't untrack; new scratch is hidden by default.
# When a new file is keeper-grade, `git add -f` it.
mlb_pipeline/_*.py

# Content backups / preserve markers + dated scratch
content/*.local-backup
content/*.preserve
content/*_breakdown.md
content/*_breakdown.txt
mlb_pipeline/_chain_failures/
mlb_pipeline/_pbp_cache/
.gamelog_cache/

# 2026-10-14 — gaps that let 266 scratch/cache files into commit 99979287.
# The enumerated `mlb_pipeline/_*.{txt,csv,json}` rules above missed .log and
# .md, and nothing covered the pitcher cache or the _analysis dump dir, so a
# `git add -A mlb_pipeline/` swept all of it in alongside a 16-line fix.
# Deliberately NOT a blanket `mlb_pipeline/_*`: legitimately tracked
# `_`-prefixed .py files predate the scratch convention and a blanket rule
# would misrepresent them as ignored.
mlb_pipeline/.pitcher_cache/
mlb_pipeline/_analysis/
mlb_pipeline/_*.log
mlb_pipeline/_*.md
mlb_pipeline/_*.jsonl
mlb_pipeline/audit_phase2_recal_dryrun_*.json
